        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.\n- People: Dennis Fimple\n- Topics: Film release order\n\nFacts:\n- Disney released \"Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.\" as a film in 1966.\n- Dennis Fimple appeared in a later film than \"Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.\"\n- The statement that \"Lt. Robin Crusoe U.S.N.\" premiered in 1982 is incorrect.",
